  "description": "ULID ID generation extension for FS.EntityFramework.Library with full Domain-Driven Design (DDD) support. Provides chronologically sortable, human-readable unique identifiers perfect for enterprise microservice architectures, Aggregate Roots, and Domain Entities. Includes automatic generation, Entity Framework optimizations, and comprehensive DDD integration.",
